{
  "id": "explore-recording-rules-read-a-rule",
  "title": "Read one recording rule",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Explore one Grafana-managed recording rule to see the parts that make it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "read-a-rule",
      "title": "Read one recording rule",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "content": "If you aren't on the **Alert rules** page, click **Alerts & IRM**, then **Alerting**, then **Alert rules** in the main menu.",
          "requirements": ["navmenu-open"],
          "skippable": true,
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "a[data-testid='data-testid Nav menu item'][href='/alerts-and-incidents']",
              "requirements": ["navmenu-open", "exists-reftarget"]
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "a[data-testid='data-testid Nav menu item'][href='/alerting']",
              "requirements": ["navmenu-open", "exists-reftarget"]
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "a[data-testid='data-testid Nav menu item'][href='/alerting/list']",
              "requirements": ["navmenu-open", "exists-reftarget"]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid alerting search-input']",
          "targetvalue": "asserts:kpi:feo11y_latency:p75 - Frontend/lcp",
          "requirements": ["on-page:/alerting/list", "exists-reftarget"],
          "content": "In the search box, enter `asserts:kpi:feo11y_latency:p75 - Frontend/lcp`, then press Enter. The list now shows only that rule."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "a[href='/alerting/grafana/afyms4tv2e58gc/view']",
          "requirements": ["on-page:/alerting/list", "exists-reftarget"],
          "content": "Click **asserts:kpi:feo11y_latency:p75 - Frontend/lcp** to open this Grafana-managed recording rule."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "h1",
          "requirements": ["on-page:/alerting/grafana/afyms4tv2e58gc/view", "exists-reftarget"],
          "doIt": false,
          "content": "Focus on the rule name at the top of the page."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "A recording rule has two names. The rule name identifies the recording rule."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "div:text('Metric name')",
          "requirements": ["on-page:/alerting/grafana/afyms4tv2e58gc/view", "exists-reftarget"],
          "doIt": false,
          "content": "Find **Metric name**."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "The metric name identifies the recorded metric. Dashboards and alert rules query the recorded metric by this name. This rule's metric name is `asserts:kpi:feo11y_latency:p75`, which is different from the rule name."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "div:text('Evaluation interval')",
          "requirements": ["on-page:/alerting/grafana/afyms4tv2e58gc/view", "exists-reftarget"],
          "doIt": false,
          "content": "Notice **Evaluation interval**."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "The evaluation interval is how often a recording rule is evaluated. This rule is evaluated every minute. Each evaluation writes one new data point to the recorded metric."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='queries-container']",
          "requirements": ["on-page:/alerting/grafana/afyms4tv2e58gc/view", "exists-reftarget"],
          "doIt": false,
          "content": "View the query. The name above the query is the data source the rule queries."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "The data source the rule queries is where the rule reads the raw data. This rule reads from `grafanacloud-play-logs`, a logs data source."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[aria-labelledby='target-datasource-uid']",
          "requirements": ["on-page:/alerting/grafana/afyms4tv2e58gc/view", "exists-reftarget"],
          "doIt": false,
          "content": "Find **Target data source**."
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "The target data source is where the rule writes the recorded metric. This rule writes to `grafanacloud-play-prom`, so it reads from one data source and writes to another."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "A recording rule has a rule name, a metric name, an evaluation interval, a data source it queries, and a target data source."
    }
  ]
}
